c-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-concepts.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-03T18:06:37+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-12T04:12:51+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals/", "title": "SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af \u5185\u90e8\u5b9f\u88c5\uff08API \u4ed5\u69d8 / ssdmond\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u6a5f\u80fd\u306e API \u4ed5\u69d8\uff08SsdBase / SsdUtil \u306e public method\uff09\u3068 Optional \u5e38\u6642\u76e3\u8996\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3 ssdmond \u306e\u8a2d\u8a08\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-03T18:06:37+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-12T04:12:51+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations/", "title": "SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af \u5236\u9650\u4e8b\u9805\u3068 HLD-\u5b9f\u88c5\u4e56\u96e2", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u6a5f\u80fd\u306e\u5236\u9650\u4e8b\u9805\u30fb\u5e72\u6e09\u3059\u308b\u6a5f\u80fd\u30fb\u30c8\u30e9\u30d6\u30eb\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u3001\u304a\u3088\u3073\u73fe\u884c master \u3068 HLD \u8a18\u8ff0\u306e\u4e56\u96e2\uff08ssdutil \u3078\u306e\u79fb\u884c\u3001sonic_storage \u518d\u69cb\u6210\u3001ssdmond \u672a\u53d6\u308a\u8fbc\u307f\uff09\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-03T18:06:37+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-12T04:12:51+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations/", "title": "SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af \u904b\u7528\uff08CLI / \u8868\u793a\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u6a5f\u80fd\u306e CLI\uff08show platform ssdhealth\uff09\u306e\u4f7f\u3044\u65b9\u3068 3 \u8868\u793a\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\uff08brief / verbose / vendor\uff09\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306e\u6709\u7121\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-03T18:06:37+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-12T04:12:51+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design/", "title": "SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\uff08show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil \u30d7\u30e9\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\uff09", "content_html": "SSD \u30d8\u30eb\u30b9\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\uff08show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil \u30d7\u30e9\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u304c\u52d5\u304f NOS \u306f\u7d44\u307f\u8fbc\u307f SSD / mSATA \u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u3092\u884c\u3046\u305f\u3081\u3001\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u5bff\u547d\u3068\u5065\u5168\u6027\u3092\u904b\u7528\u8005\u304c\u628a\u63e1\u3067\u304d\u308b \u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-03T18:06:37+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:1